  "proof": "The exact-real weights are the unique solution of the selected 13x13 system. Arb proves its determinant excludes zero and every weight is strictly positive. D10 symmetrization makes each principal-minor coordinate equal its orbit average. The pair identity sum_{|I|=2} det(Q_I)=e2(Q)=-5 fixes the fifth pair orbit. For each 3-set K, sum_{I superset K, |I|=4} det(Q_I)=-sum_{J subset K, |J|=2} det(Q_J). The 8x8 first-eight-quartic incidence minor has exact determinant 64, so the four pair coordinates and eight free quartic coordinates determine all 16 quartic orbits. The balanced target satisfies these same identities exactly. Finally Jacobi's complementary minor identity and Q^{-1}=Q, det(Q)=-1 give order-6 and order-8 moments from orders 4 and 2. Thus all 512 even subsets, not only the selected 12 coordinates, match exactly.",
